<title>NIGERIA: TABLE-Nigerian Guinness Q1 profits steady.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Nigerian Guinness Q1 profits steady.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter result to end-March 1997 for brewer Guinness Nigeria Plc.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>				     1997	 1996</p>
<p>    Turnover		    2,100  vs  2,200</p>
<p>Profit before taxation  251.7  vs  250.1</p>
<p>    Taxation		     80.5  vs   80</p>
<p>    Profit after taxation   171.2  vs  170</p>
<p>($1= 83.20 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
